OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton thanked for inspiring
OL,4,AScots children to love books
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish council has credited Dolly
OL,7,FParton, who has died at the age of 80,
OL,8,Fwith inspiring a love of reading among
OL,9,Fchildren in its area.
OL,11,FRenfrewshire Council said the country
OL,12,Fmusic star's Imagination Library had
OL,13,Fhelped to put books in the hands of
OL,14,Fsome of its youngest children.
OL,16,FThe local authority announced in March
OL,17,Fit would dedicate a day to Parton every
OL,18,Fyear to mark the impact of her reading
OL,19,Fscheme. Its first Dolly Parton Day is
OL,20,Fdue to take place on 25 September.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
