OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton thanked for inspiring
OL,4,AScots children to love books
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Imagination Library supplies
OL,7,Fchildren aged two to five with free
OL,8,Fbooks, and the Scottish launch of the
OL,9,Fliteracy initiative was held in Wigtown
OL,10,Fin 2008.
